  _periodsDescriptions:
  - period: 0
    description: After a time paradox, this armour became a percussion instrument
      used during the first <b>prehistoric</b> parties.
  - period: 1
    description: After a time paradox, this armour allowed chubby warriors to fight
      alongside their athletic mates during <b>Antiquity</b>'s conflicts.
  - period: 2
    description: This armour was the main piece of every <b>knight</b>'s equipment
      during the Middle Ages.
  - period: 3
    description: After a time paradox, this armour is now worn during <b>aristocratic</b>
      ball to aura farm.
